<view class="page dock-page" wx:if="{{job}}"><view class="heading">审核作业</view><view class="link" bindtap="toggleDetails">原始消息 / 用量与费用 {{showDetails?'收起':'展开'}}</view><block wx:if="{{showDetails}}"><view wx:if="{{job.import_kind==='manual'}}" class="card">直接录入 · 未调用AI，费用为零。请核对规则识别的学科、日期和优先级。</view><view wx:elif="{{job.billing}}" class="card"><view>本版本 AI 估算 / 预留：¥{{job.billing.display}} / ¥{{job.billing.budgetCny}}</view><view class="muted">生成 {{job.billing.count}} / 2 次 · 已知输入 {{job.billing.input}} / 输出 {{job.billing.output}} tokens（含思考）。金额不等于平台账单，发布和多孩子分发不再调用AI。</view><view wx:if="{{job.billing.legacyUsageUnknown}}" class="warning">旧版用量未知，该批仅支持手动整理。</view></view><view class="sub">所属日期 {{job.work_date}} · 科目、页码、题号请以原消息为准。</view><view class="card"><view class="heading">原始消息</view><view class="content">{{job.source_text || '本次来自截图，请对照手机原图核对。'}}</view><view class="muted" wx:for="{{job.attachments}}" wx:key="id">附件：{{item.name}}</view></view></block><view wx:if="{{job.error}}" class="warning">{{job.error}}</view><block wx:if="{{job.status==='review'||job.status==='failed'}}"><view class="warning" wx:for="{{job.result.notices}}" wx:key="*this">通知（不作为作业发布）：{{item}}</view><button wx:if="{{job.import_kind!=='manual'}}" bindtap="merge" disabled="{{selected.length<2}}">合并所选任务（{{selected.length}}）</button><checkbox-group bindchange="selectItems"><view wx:for="{{job.result.items}}" wx:key="index" class="card"><label wx:if="{{job.import_kind!=='manual'}}" class="check"><checkbox value="{{index}}" checked="{{selectionFlags[index] || false}}"/>选择合并</label><view class="label">科目</view><picker range="{{item.subjectChoices}}" value="{{item.subjectIndex}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindchange="subjectChange"><view class="subject-picker">{{item.subject==='待确认'?'请选择科目':item.subject}} ▾</view></picker><view class="row"><view>优先任务</view><switch checked="{{item.priority==='high'}}" color="#bb7627" data-index="{{index}}" bindchange="priorityChange"/></view><view class="label">分类依据（仅家长可见）</view><input value="{{item.priorityReason}}" maxlength="200" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="priorityReason" bindinput="input"/><view class="label">作业要求</view><textarea value="{{item.content}}" maxlength="3000" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="content" bindinput="input"/><view class="label">截止日期（可留空）</view><input value="{{item.dueDate}}" placeholder="YYYY-MM-DD" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="dueDate" bindinput="input"/><view class="label">准备材料</view><input value="{{item.materials}}" maxlength="500" data-index="{{index}}" data-field="materials" bindinput="input"/><view wx:if="{{item.warning}}" class="warning">待确认：{{item.warning}}</view><button wx:if="{{job.import_kind!=='manual'}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="split">按换行拆分任务</button><button data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="remove">删除这一项</button></view></checkbox-group><button wx:if="{{job.import_kind!=='manual'}}" bindtap="add">添加作业</button><button wx:if="{{job.status==='failed'}}" bindtap="retry" disabled="{{busy}}">重新分析</button><view class="bottom-dock" style="bottom:{{keyboard}}px"><button bindtap="saveClick" disabled="{{busy}}">保存草稿</button><button class="primary" bindtap="publish" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy||hasUnknownSubject||!job.result.items.length}}">发布作业</button></view></block><block wx:elif="{{job.status==='published'}}"><view class="card">已发布。个别作业编辑可在网页家长端操作。</view><button bindtap="withdraw" disabled="{{busy}}">撤回整批重新审核</button></block><view wx:else class="card">正在等待 Kimi 分析，结果会自动刷新。</view></view>
